      {
        "id": "model-prototype-contract",
        "moduleId": "operation-prototypes",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "补充：原型注释就是调用契约",
        "markdown": "**模型补充**：原型里的注释不是装饰，而是调用契约。\n\n- **初始条件**说明调用前提：`T` 已存在、`1 ≤ i ≤ 3`；\n- **操作结果**说明可观察的效果：返回第 i 元的值、把第 i 元改成 e、返回最大值等。\n\n实现必须在这两个边界内行为一致。先写原型再写实现，可以让接口与实现分开检查，这也是把 ADT 落成代码时的通用步骤。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-triplet-type"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-triplet-impl",
        "moduleId": "implementation-walkthrough",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "code",
        "title": "教材：基本操作的实现",
        "markdown": "实现按原型逐条落地，下面是最关键的几个操作：\n\n```c\nStatus InitTriplet(Triplet &T, ElemType v1, ElemType v2, ElemType v3) {\n    T = (ElemType *)malloc(3 * sizeof(ElemType));\n    if (!T) exit(OVERFLOW);\n    T[0] = v1;  T[1] = v2;  T[2] = v3;\n    return OK;\n}\n\nStatus DestroyTriplet(Triplet &T) {\n    free(T);  T = NULL;\n    return OK;\n}\n\nStatus Get(Triplet T, int i, ElemType &e) {\n    if (i < 1 || i > 3) return ERROR;\n    e = T[i - 1];\n    return OK;\n}\n\nStatus Put(Triplet &T, int i, ElemType e) {\n    if (i < 1 || i > 3) return ERROR;\n    T[i - 1] = e;\n    return OK;\n}\n```\n\n判断升序和降序直接比较相邻两对元素：`IsAscending` 返回 `(T[0] <= T[1]) && (T[1] <= T[2])`，`IsDescending` 返回 `(T[0] >= T[1]) && (T[1] >= T[2])`。`Max` 与 `Min` 则用嵌套条件表达式在两两比较中选出结果。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
